O. Reg. 516/06 (General), a regulation under the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006, s. 7 – Rental unit in care home (part 1 of 2)
(1) Subsections 37 (4) and (5) of the Act do not apply to a rental unit in a care home if,
(a) the rental unit is occupied for the purpose of receiving rehabilitative or therapeutic services agreed upon by the tenant and the landlord;
